  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Davleia/Kastro. Pausanias offers interesting commentary about a sanctuary of Athena located at Daulis that housed a wooden cult image or <i>xoanon</i> that was said to have been brought from Athens by Procne.</p>",
